/* The inventory's modern look (P14 spec 6.1; the stage 1 design,
   Inventory board): a 236dp window at the screen's right above the taskbar
   (legacy's place; the controller keeps the player's drags). The paper
   doll: legacy's equipment slots at their EquipmentSlot places (a 150 x 182
   slot space scaled so a 32px slot is the 40dp cell, every gap between two
   neighbors the modern 4dp so the cells' shared 2dp hit outsets tile them),
   over a figure (an image the controller passes, by the race), a diamond
   lattice and a soft accent light behind it, a rune circle in perspective
   under its feet that turns slowly and rests under reduced motion, and
   corner brackets, all code but the figure; the costume, dragon soul and
   item shop buttons where legacy's equipment base holds them. Under it the
   stats row, the page tabs (one per page, in a segmented well), the bag (a
   lean slot grid of 5 x 44dp columns) and the money. The shortcut rail
   docks on the window's left edge while it has entries. Classic (legacy's
   176 x 565 board, its art and places; OLD's 196 x 627 at the
   foundation's table): skins/classic/windows/inventory.rcss. */

body.inv
{
	right: 0;
	bottom: 37dp;
	width: 236dp;
	min-width: 0;
	focus: none;
	tab-index: none;
}
/* Placed from Python (above the NovaUI taskbar, or where the player left
   it): the placement writes left and top only, so right and bottom give way
   and the board keeps its own height. */
body.inv.inv--placed
{
	right: auto;
	bottom: auto;
}
.inv button
{
	tab-index: none;
}
.inv__body
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	align-items: center;
	padding: var(--space-2);
	gap: var(--space-2);
}
.inv-tip
{
	white-space: nowrap;
}

/* --- The paper doll ------------------------------------------------------------ */

/* The equipment's well: the panel's gradient under the diamond lattice (two
   sets of thin lines, 45 degrees either way); its edge line is the art's
   (a border here would move the belt's dock by a rounded pixel). */
.inv-equip
{
	position: relative;
	width: 216dp;
	height: 256dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	border-radius: 12dp;
	decorator: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--border) 0dp, var(--border) 0.7dp, transparent 0.7dp, transparent 7.6dp),
	           repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--border) 0dp, var(--border) 0.7dp, transparent 0.7dp, transparent 7.6dp),
	           linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface) 0%, var(--surface-sunken) 100%);
}
/* The art takes no pointer: the wear cells and buttons over it do. It
   draws the well's edge line. */
.inv-doll
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	width: 216dp;
	height: 256dp;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 12dp;
	pointer-events: none;
}
.inv-doll__light, .inv-doll__rune, .inv-doll__figure, .inv-doll__corner
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	pointer-events: none;
}
/* The soft accent light behind the figure, centered on the head's column. */
.inv-doll__light
{
	left: 26.5dp;
	top: 0;
	width: 125dp;
	height: 254dp;
	decorator: radial-gradient(50% 58% at 50% 60%, var(--slot-target) 0%, transparent 72%);
}
/* A device without effects draws a gradient as its middle color: the light
   would be a flat box. */
@media (theme: no-effects)
{
	.inv-doll__light
	{
		display: none;
	}
}
/* The figure (325 x 484 px, drawn for 200%): its box in legacy slot units
   at -16.4, 4.1, 116.5 x 173.4, so the hood is at the head slot and the
   feet at the shoes slot. At 0.7 over the well its steel reads as the
   design's figure on the dark and on the light well alike. */
.inv-doll__figure
{
	left: -0.25dp;
	top: 9.625dp;
	width: 145.625dp;
	height: 216.75dp;
	opacity: 0.7;
}
/* The rune circle under the feet: rings, eight marks and a hexagram on a
   156dp disc laid back in perspective; the disc turns once in 26s. */
.inv-doll__rune
{
	left: 11dp;
	top: 151dp;
	width: 156dp;
	height: 156dp;
	transform: perspective(300dp) rotateX(74deg);
}
.inv-doll__spin
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	width: 156dp;
	height: 156dp;
}
.inv-doll__spin.nui-anim
{
	animation: 26s linear-in-out infinite inv-rune-turn;
}
@keyframes inv-rune-turn
{
	from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
	to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
.inv-doll__ring, .inv-doll__tick, .inv-doll__chord
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	box-sizing: border-box;
}
.inv-doll__ring
{
	border-color: var(--accent-glow);
	border-radius: 9999dp;
}
.inv-doll__ring--outer
{
	left: 4dp;
	top: 4dp;
	width: 148dp;
	height: 148dp;
	border-width: 2.5dp;
}
.inv-doll__ring--glow
{
	left: 12dp;
	top: 12dp;
	width: 132dp;
	height: 132dp;
	border-width: 2dp;
	border-color: var(--accent);
}
.inv-doll__ring--inner
{
	left: 26dp;
	top: 26dp;
	width: 104dp;
	height: 104dp;
	border-width: 1.5dp;
}
/* The marks: four bars across the disc, each drawing its two ends at the
   outer ring. */
.inv-doll__tick
{
	left: 0;
	top: 75dp;
	width: 156dp;
	height: 6dp;
	decorator: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-glow) 0%, var(--accent-glow) 6%, transparent 6%, transparent 94%, var(--accent-glow) 94%, var(--accent-glow) 100%);
}
.inv-doll__tick--b { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.inv-doll__tick--c { transform: rotate(90deg); }
.inv-doll__tick--d { transform: rotate(135deg); }
/* The hexagram: six chords of the inner ring, each 26dp from the middle. */
.inv-doll__chord
{
	left: 33dp;
	top: 77dp;
	width: 90dp;
	height: 1.5dp;
	background-color: var(--accent-glow);
}
.inv-doll__chord--a { transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(26dp); }
.inv-doll__chord--b { transform: rotate(60deg) translateY(26dp); }
.inv-doll__chord--c { transform: rotate(120deg) translateY(26dp); }
.inv-doll__chord--d { transform: rotate(180deg) translateY(26dp); }
.inv-doll__chord--e { transform: rotate(240deg) translateY(26dp); }
.inv-doll__chord--f { transform: rotate(300deg) translateY(26dp); }
/* The corner brackets. */
.inv-doll__corner
{
	width: 14dp;
	height: 14dp;
	border-color: var(--accent-glow);
}
.inv-doll__corner--tl { left: 5dp; top: 5dp; border-left-width: 1.5dp; border-top-width: 1.5dp; }
.inv-doll__corner--tr { right: 5dp; top: 5dp; border-right-width: 1.5dp; border-top-width: 1.5dp; }
.inv-doll__corner--bl { left: 5dp; bottom: 5dp; border-left-width: 1.5dp; border-bottom-width: 1.5dp; }
.inv-doll__corner--br { right: 5dp; bottom: 5dp; border-right-width: 1.5dp; border-bottom-width: 1.5dp; }

/* A wear cell's place, by the wear slot's name (nui_limits' tables): a
   place the table in use lacks has no element. Today's places are legacy's
   EquipmentSlot places (uiscript inventorywindow.py) at 1.25 from (26, 8)
   in the doll, with every gap between two neighbors evened to the modern
   4dp (legacy's run from 0 to 7px: the right column stands 5dp nearer,
   and no place moves more than 4dp up or down): the cells' shared 2dp hit
   outsets (components/slot-grid.rcss; a window sheet sets none) meet in
   each gap, so the pointer between two cells is over one of them (P14b). */
.inv-wear-place
{
	position: absolute;
	width: 40dp;
	height: 40dp;
}
/* The tall places: the weapon is 32 x 96 in legacy, the armor 32 x 64. */
.inv-wear--weapon { height: 120dp; }
.inv-wear--body { height: 80dp; }
/* The wear cell fills its place; the item's icon at its own size in the
   middle (a 1x2 sword in the weapon's place too). */
.inv-wear
{
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
}
.inv-wear .nui-slot__icon
{
	height: auto;
}
/* A refined wear item (inv-wear--refined): a ring and a soft glow around
   its cell in the upgrade blue (--inv-refine-ring, which a skin may
   recolor), drawn once as a shadow, so the cell's own hover and drop
   states still show inside it (a device without effects draws neither,
   base.rcss); its "+N" (is-refined) at the top right. */
.inv-wear
{
	--inv-refine-ring: var(--gauge-blue);
}
.inv-wear--refined.nui-fx
{
	box-shadow: 0 0 0 1dp var(--inv-refine-ring), 0 0 8dp var(--inv-refine-ring);
}
.inv-wear.is-refined .nui-slot__number
{
	left: auto;
	right: 2dp;
}
/* An empty place's mark (the unique, arrow and belt glyphs), a faint
   watermark in the cell's middle. */
.inv-wear .inv-wear__mark
{
	transform: scale(1.3);
	opacity: 0.5;
	--glyph-ink: var(--text-muted);
}
.inv-wear--weapon { left: 26dp; top: 9dp; }
.inv-wear--unique1 { left: 26dp; top: 187dp; }
.inv-wear--head { left: 70dp; top: 8dp; }
.inv-wear--body { left: 70dp; top: 52dp; }
.inv-wear--belt { left: 70dp; top: 136dp; }
.inv-wear--foots { left: 70dp; top: 187dp; }
.inv-wear--shield { left: 114dp; top: 48dp; }
.inv-wear--wrist { left: 114dp; top: 92dp; }
.inv-wear--unique2 { left: 114dp; top: 187dp; }
.inv-wear--arrow { left: 158dp; top: 5dp; }
.inv-wear--ear { left: 158dp; top: 49dp; }
.inv-wear--neck { left: 158dp; top: 93dp; }
/* Today's table since the cut (NOVA-97): the rings either side of the
   belt, on its row, as legacy's uiscript has them; the weapon starts 4dp
   lower so it ends with the body and the bracelet, 4dp above the rings
   (every gap 4dp, so the cells' hit boxes tile, P14b). */
body.inv.inv--table-new .inv-wear--weapon { top: 12dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-new .inv-wear--ring1,
body.inv.inv--table-new .inv-wear--ring2 { top: 136dp; }
/* OLD's slots for a table that holds them (the foundation's): the rings
   under the weapon and the bracelet, the sash over the shield, which moves
   one row down; its buttons stack under the necklace. */
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--weapon { top: 8dp; }
.inv-wear--ring1 { left: 26dp; top: 132dp; }
.inv-wear--costume_sash { left: 114dp; top: 8dp; }
.inv-wear--ring2 { left: 114dp; top: 140dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--shield { top: 52dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--wrist { top: 96dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--arrow { top: 8dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--ear { top: 52dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--neck { top: 96dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--unique1,
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--foots,
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-wear--unique2 { top: 189dp; }

/* The costume, dragon soul and item shop buttons: round, centered where
   legacy puts them (slot space 94, 21; 130, 124; 130, 164). */
.inv-button
{
	position: absolute;
	width: 32dp;
	height: 32dp;
	min-width: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 16dp;
	line-height: 30dp;
	decorator: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, var(--surface-hover) 0%, var(--surface-sunken) 75%);
}
.inv-button .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--text);
}
.inv-button:hover .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--accent);
}
.inv-button--costume { left: 121dp; top: 15dp; }
.inv-button--dss
{
	left: 159dp;
	top: 141dp;
	width: 36dp;
	height: 36dp;
	border-radius: 18dp;
	line-height: 34dp;
}
.inv-button--mall
{
	left: 162dp;
	top: 195dp;
	width: 30dp;
	height: 30dp;
	border-radius: 15dp;
	line-height: 28dp;
}
.inv-button--mall .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--warning);
}
/* The dragon soul window's active effect: an accent ring on the button. */
.inv-button--dss.is-on
{
	border-color: var(--accent);
}
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--costume,
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--dss,
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--mall
{
	left: 163dp;
	width: 28dp;
	height: 28dp;
	border-radius: 14dp;
	line-height: 26dp;
}
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--costume { top: 140dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--dss { top: 170dp; }
body.inv.inv--table-old .inv-button--mall { top: 200dp; }
/* The legacy active effect over the dragon soul button is classic's. */
.inv-button__effect
{
	display: none;
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	pointer-events: none;
}

/* The belt docks here: its right edge on the inventory's left edge, its top
   at the bag's top (place_next_to). The equipment starts 11dp inside the
   body's border box (the 1dp border, the body's 8dp padding, 2dp of
   centering). */
.inv-belt-dock
{
	position: absolute;
	left: -11dp;
	top: 334dp;
	width: 0;
	height: 0;
}

/* --- The stats row ----------------------------------------------------------- */

.inv-stats
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	justify-content: center;
	gap: 6dp;
	width: 216dp;
}
.inv-stat
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	height: 20dp;
	padding: 0 7dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 10dp;
	color: var(--text);
	font-size: var(--font-xs);
	font-weight: bold;
	white-space: nowrap;
}
.inv-stat__value
{
	margin-left: 5dp;
	line-height: 18dp;
}
/* The icons, two parts each in the accent: crossed blades (attack), a
   shield (defence) and a star of two squares (magic attack). */
.inv-stat__icon
{
	display: block;
	position: relative;
	width: 11dp;
	height: 11dp;
}
.inv-stat__a, .inv-stat__b
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	border-color: var(--accent);
}
.inv-stat__icon--attack .inv-stat__a, .inv-stat__icon--attack .inv-stat__b
{
	left: -1dp;
	top: 4.75dp;
	width: 13dp;
	height: 1.5dp;
	background-color: var(--accent);
}
.inv-stat__icon--attack .inv-stat__a { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.inv-stat__icon--attack .inv-stat__b { transform: rotate(-45deg); }
.inv-stat__icon--defence .inv-stat__a
{
	left: 1dp;
	top: 0;
	width: 9dp;
	height: 11dp;
	border-width: 1.5dp;
	border-radius: 2dp 2dp 5dp 5dp;
}
.inv-stat__icon--magic .inv-stat__a, .inv-stat__icon--magic .inv-stat__b
{
	left: 2dp;
	top: 2dp;
	width: 7dp;
	height: 7dp;
	border-width: 1.5dp;
}
.inv-stat__icon--magic .inv-stat__b { transform: rotate(45deg); }

/* --- The page tabs: a segmented well, the page shown raised ------------------- */

.inv-tabs
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	gap: 2dp;
	width: 216dp;
	padding: 3dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 9dp;
}
.inv-tab
{
	flex: 1 1 0;
	min-width: 0;
	height: 24dp;
	padding: 0;
	line-height: 22dp;
}
.inv-tabs .inv-tab
{
	border-color: transparent;
	border-radius: 6dp;
	background-color: transparent;
	color: var(--text-muted);
}
.inv-tabs .inv-tab:hover
{
	background-color: var(--surface-hover);
	color: var(--text);
}
.inv-tabs .inv-tab.is-selected
{
	background-color: var(--surface-raised);
	border-color: var(--border);
	color: var(--text);
}
.inv-tab__label
{
	pointer-events: none;
}

/* --- The bag and the money ------------------------------------------------- */

.inv-bag
{
	flex: 0 0 auto;
}
/* The money: the coin, then a sunken field with the amount on its right,
   wide enough for MONEY_DIGITS and their separators. */
.inv-money
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	width: 216dp;
	height: 28dp;
	gap: 6dp;
}
.inv-money__coin
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--warning);
}
.inv-money__amount
{
	flex: 1 1 auto;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: 28dp;
	padding: 0 9dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 7dp;
	color: var(--text);
	font-size: var(--font-sm);
	font-weight: bold;
	line-height: 26dp;
	text-align: right;
	white-space: nowrap;
	pointer-events: none;
}
.inv-money:hover .inv-money__amount
{
	border-color: var(--accent);
}

/* --- The shortcut rail ----------------------------------------------------- */

/* A slim board on the window's left edge, under its title bar: one 36dp
   button per entry, a 24dp glyph in each, its hint on the left; under them
   a rule and the fold button. A badge (a count) sits on a button's top
   right corner; a feature still to come draws its glyph faint, its hint
   with a second line, and takes no accent on hover (no press). Folded,
   only the grip and the fold button stay. */
.inv-rail
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	align-items: center;
	position: absolute;
	right: 100%;
	top: 46dp;
	margin-right: 6dp;
	padding: 8dp 6dp 6dp 6dp;
	gap: 6dp;
}
.inv-rail.is-empty
{
	display: none;
}
.inv-rail.is-folded .inv-rail__button, .inv-rail.is-folded .inv-rail__more
{
	display: none;
}
.inv-rail__grip
{
	display: block;
	width: 16dp;
	height: 3dp;
	margin-bottom: 1dp;
	border-radius: 2dp;
	background-color: var(--border);
}
.inv-rail__button
{
	position: relative;
	width: 36dp;
	height: 36dp;
	min-width: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 10dp;
	line-height: 34dp;
}
.inv-rail__glyph
{
	transform: scale(1.5);
}
.inv-rail__button:hover .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--accent);
}
.inv-rail__button.is-soon .inv-rail__glyph
{
	opacity: 0.45;
}
.inv-rail__button.is-soon:hover .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--text);
}
.inv-rail__badge
{
	position: absolute;
	right: -5dp;
	top: -5dp;
	min-width: 5dp;
	height: 15dp;
	padding: 0 4dp;
	border-width: 2dp;
	border-color: var(--surface);
	background-color: var(--danger);
	color: var(--text-inverse);
	line-height: 15dp;
	text-align: center;
}
.inv-rail__more
{
	display: block;
	width: 22dp;
	height: 1dp;
	margin: 2dp 0;
	background-color: var(--border);
}
.inv-rail__fold
{
	position: relative;
	width: 36dp;
	height: 18dp;
	min-width: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-radius: 7dp;
	line-height: 16dp;
}
.inv-rail__fold-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--text-muted);
	transform: scale(0.75);
}
.inv-rail__fold:hover .inv-rail__fold-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--accent);
}
.inv-rail__tip
{
	left: auto;
	right: 100%;
	bottom: auto;
	top: 7dp;
	margin: 0 8dp 0 -320dp;
}
.inv-rail__tip--fold
{
	top: -4dp;
}
.inv-rail__soon
{
	display: block;
	opacity: 0.75;
	font-size: var(--font-xs);
}
